ement request.\n\nRead all files in this folder. Apply the current finance policy, classify each expense, calculate the reimbursable total, and identify approved, capped or partially reimbursed, and rejected items.\n\nCreate the deliverables listed in `output_contract.md` inside an `answer/` folder in this task folder. The goal is to leave behind useful audit artifacts that another finance reviewer could inspect.\n\nYour work must make the policy-selection step, item-level audit step, and reimbursement-summary step visible as separate checkpoints.","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":9,"totalLines":9,"truncated":false}},"title":"tasks/travel_reimbursement_audit/task.md","time":{"start":1781563424583,"end":1781563424604}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_02a3b30fefb8d308016a308020955881918870f7651802a726"}},"id":"prt_ecd747f3d001MmlDADs5FeNtFg","sessionID":"ses_1328b9ab2ffeOhczfsgewRmTkz","messageID":"msg_ecd74701d001ZEHe4y2FBOzDNQ"}}
