upgrade is not reimbursable without written preapproval; receipt shows no written preapproval. |\n+| T-003 | $510.00 | $440.00 | $70.00 | partial | Lodging cap is $220.00 per night for 2 covered nights, so reimbursement is capped at $440.00. |\n+| T-004 | $76.00 | $58.00 | $18.00 | partial | Meal receipt includes $18.00 of alcohol, which is not reimbursable; remaining $58.00 food cost is within the $65.00 daily meal cap. |\n+| T-005 | $70.00 | $60.00 | $10.00 | partial | Ride-share base fare of $50.00 is reimbursable; tip is capped at 20% of base fare, so only $10.00 of the $20.00 tip is reimbursable. |\n+| T-006 | $82.00 | $0.00 | $82.00 | rejected | Supplies expense is $75.00 or more, so a receipt is required; no receipt was provided. |\n+| T-007 | $18.00 | $18.00 | $0.00 | approved | Meal receipt is present, no alcohol is noted, and $18.00 is within the $65.00 daily meal cap. |\n","additions":11,"deletions":0},{"filePath":"/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/travel_reimbursement_audit/answer/reimbursement_summary.md","relativePath":"tasks/travel_reimbursement_audit/answer/reimbursement_summary.md","type":"add","patch":"Index: /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/travel_reimbursement_audit/answer/reimbursement_summary.md\n===================================================================\n--- /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/travel_reimbursement_audit/answer/reimbursement_summary.md\n+++ /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/travel_reimbursement_audit/answer/reimbursement_summary.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,13 @@\n+## Reimbursement Summary Checkpoint\n+\n+- Reimbursable total: $1,056.00\n+- Non-reimbursable total: $225.00\n+- Reimbursable total calculation: `$480.00 + $0.00 + $440.00 + $58.00 + $60.00 + $0.00 + $18.00 = $1,056.00`\n+- Fully approved expense IDs: `T-001`, `T-007`\n+- Partially reimbursed or capped expense IDs: `T-003`, `T-004`, `T-005`\n+- Rejected expense IDs: `T-002`, `T-006`\n+\n+## Finance Notes\n+\n+- The current 2026-04-20 policy appl